<cb/>
<div n="1" type="jPoliticalNews">             <div n="2">                <div n="3" type="jArticle" xml:id="ungarn2" prev="#ungarn1">                   <p>aufge&#x017F;tellt; &#x017F;olange er am Ruder i&#x017F;t, will die Oppo&#x017F;i-<lb/>
